Internal Markdown parser adapter

dist/syntax/parser.generated.js bundles the Markdown parser and selected GFM
and CJK extension factories. It includes adaptations to micromark-util-edit-map,
mdast-util-from-markdown, micromark, micromark-core-commonmark,
micromark-extension-gfm-autolink-literal, micromark-extension-gfm-footnote,
micromark-extension-gfm-strikethrough, and micromark-extension-cjk-friendly.

The complete MIT license texts and copyright notices for all 34 bundled
packages are included in dist/syntax/parser.generated.LICENSES.txt. The adjacent
parser.generated.manifest.json identifies their exact versions, source and
license hashes, and the local corrections' provenance. Those full license
texts apply to the bundled and adapted code and accompany every distribution.

